7
00:00:31,700 --> 00:00:36,940
Kajian lain tengok warga emas minum jus buah beri goji ni

8
00:00:36,940 --> 00:00:38,620
90 hari.

9
00:00:39,140 --> 00:00:46,000
Parazesentin dan antioksidan mereka naik.

10
00:00:46,820 --> 00:00:51,440
